OL,3,GNEWSAWomen continue quirky challenges
OL,4,Ato honour friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of women dressed as flamingos
OL,7,Fwill take on a "punishing walk" along
OL,8,Fthe coast to honour their promise to a
OL,9,Flate friend to continue her legacy of
OL,10,Ffighting breast cancer.
OL,12,FLaura Plane, a teacher from Plymouth,
OL,13,Fspent her final years with terminal
OL,14,Fbreast cancer. But before her death
OL,15,Faged 37 in 2017, she had raised #80,000
OL,16,Ffor charity.
OL,18,FHaving been told her condition was
OL,19,Fincurable in 2014, Plane harnessed her
OL,20,F"vivacious" spirit to campaign for
OL,21,Fyouth breast cancer charity CoppaFeel!,
OL,22,Fher friend Claire Ray said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
